  "brain_first": "“不要找一样的英语，找一样的意思。”",
  "sort_order": 1016,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 681
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题目和选项不会照抄原句；常把动词、形容词、因",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 682
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "果表达换成近义结构。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 683
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 684
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Paraphrase / 同义改写：用不同词表达同一个信",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 685
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "息。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 686
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “不要找一样的英语，找一样的意思。”",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 687
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这是高考阅读最稳定的命题方式之一。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 688
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 689
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先把题干和选项用最简单意思概括。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 690
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 回原文定位后，找“意思对应”，不是“单词对应”。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 691
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查方向：肯定/否定、可能/一定、部分/全部。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 692
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 确认程度没有被放大。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 693
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 694
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 695
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 696
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· help → support / enable / make it easier",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 697
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· cheap → inexpensive / affordable",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 698
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· cause → lead to / result in",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 699
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· refuse → turn down / decide not to accept",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 700
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 语义、主语、范围和强度全部匹配。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 701
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不认识某个选项词时，可先用其余三个确定哪一个与原文结构最接近，再结合",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 702
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "词根/上下文猜。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 703
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 704
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "原文：The new route cuts travel time by nearly half.",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 705
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "正确改写可为：The route makes the journey much faster.",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 706
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 707
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把“同词复现”当正确证据。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 708
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略程度：may → must。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 709
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 710
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 意思同吗？",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 711
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 范围同吗？",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 712
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 强度同吗？",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 713
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 714
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 715
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 26,
      "sourceIndex": 716
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 阅读找同义，不找复制。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 717
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 719
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “cuts travel time by half”可改写为？",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 720
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. may → must 属于同义改写吗？",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 721
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. decline an offer ↔ ?",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 722
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. be likely to ↔ ?",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 723
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 同义替换最重要检查4项？",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 724
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. makes the journey much faster/shorter；2. 不是，程度被放大。；3. turn down/refuse an offer；",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 725
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. probably/may well；5. 语义、主语、范围、强度/方向。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 726
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R2 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R2”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 727
    }
